==Trivia==
*She received a stat buff in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]]. Prior to this version, her base health was 1,070 (1,660 in evolved), her base damage was 1,060 (1,520 in evolved), and her standing range was 355.
*At an unknown date, Holy Coppermine's descriptions were changed from saying "Might ''Stop'' Aliens/Angels" to "Might ''freeze'' Aliens/Angels".

